The MIT License above covers the source code only. Content shipped alongside
the code is licensed separately:

- Song data (`songs/*.json`) and the scripts that generate it: public domain
  or CC0. Classical pieces come from the Mutopia Project pages that state
  "Copyright: Public Domain"; the folk arrangements and practice pieces are
  original arrangements of public-domain melodies, released as CC0. Per-song
  provenance is listed in README.md.
- Piano samples (`samples/*.mp3`): Salamander Grand Piano by Alexander Holm,
  licensed CC-BY 3.0. Attribution is displayed in the application footer and
  must be preserved in any redistribution.
